    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University's Centre of Excellence in Women and Child Health, East Africa (CoEWCH EA) has handed over health equipment valued at KES 2 million (approximately USD 13,000) to Pumwani Maternity Hospital in Kenya to strengthen the hospital's capacity to provide comprehensive essential maternity and newborn care.",
